{
    "title": "bloopworm - comic book reader",
    "description": "<b>BLOOPWORM</b> is an AI based manga, webtoon (manhwa) and comic book reader. This app focuses on one goal and that is making the digital experience as fun as reading the physical comic books & mangas.\r\n\r\n<b><u>Features:</u></b>\r\n\r\n<b>Effortless Navigation:</b> Slide through pages and zoom in on panels with our intuitive image comic viewer.\r\n\r\n<b>Smart Reading:</b> Bloopworm's guided view automatically detects panels and text, so you can enjoy reading your collection in their natural format, whether it's webtoon, manga, or traditional comic book layouts.\r\n\r\n<b>Multiple Reading Modes:</b> Read from left to right, right to left, or choose auto-detect for a hassle-free experience.\r\n\r\n<b>View Your Way:</b> Go horizontal or vertical, whichever feels most comfortable for you.\r\n\r\n<b>Widespread File Support:</b> bloopworm opens all your favorite image formats (JPG, JPEG, PNG, and WEBP) and compressed files (CBZ, CBR, RAR, ZIP, and PDF).\r\n\r\n<b>Import from Anywhere:</b> Easily import or extract manga, image comics & webtoons (manhwa) from any folder on your device.\r\n\r\n<b>Organized Library:</b> Our built-in file management system lets you keep your collection organized, so you can always find what you're looking for.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>BLOOPWORM</b> is an AI based manga, webtoon (manhwa) and comic book reader. This app focuses on one goal and that is making the digital experience as fun as reading the physical comic books &amp; mangas.<br><br><b><u>Features:</u></b><br><br><b>Effortless Navigation:</b> Slide through pages and zoom in on panels with our intuitive image comic viewer.<br><br><b>Smart Reading:</b> Bloopworm&#39;s guided view automatically detects panels and text, so you can enjoy reading your collection in their natural format, whether it&#39;s webtoon, manga, or traditional comic book layouts.<br><br><b>Multiple Reading Modes:</b> Read from left to right, right to left, or choose auto-detect for a hassle-free experience.<br><br><b>View Your Way:</b> Go horizontal or vertical, whichever feels most comfortable for you.<br><br><b>Widespread File Support:</b> bloopworm opens all your favorite image formats (JPG, JPEG, PNG, and WEBP) and compressed files (CBZ, CBR, RAR, ZIP, and PDF).<br><br><b>Import from Anywhere:</b> Easily import or extract manga, image comics &amp; webtoons (manhwa) from any folder on your device.<br><br><b>Organized Library:</b> Our built-in file management system lets you keep your collection organized, so you can always find what you&#39;re looking for.",
